    },
    {
      "occurrence": 5,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Hey, I think you'd better be leaving. We don't want your kind here.",
      "source_text": "Hey, I think you'd better be leaving. We don't want your kind here.",
      "source_line_start": 6,
      "source_line_end": 6,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 6,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "嘿！我认为你最好离开这儿。我们不希望有你这样的人在这里。",
      "source_text": "嘿！我认为你最好离开这儿。我们不希望有你这样的人在这里。",
      "source_line_start": 7,
      "source_line_end": 7,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 7,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "I can't believe that Tandi has disappeared. I hope you are going to find her. It would really hurt Aradesh if something bad happened to her.",
      "source_text": "I can't believe that Tandi has disappeared. I hope you are going to find her. It would really hurt Aradesh if something bad happened to her.",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 8,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "难以相信，坦蒂居然失踪了。我希望你能找找她。如果有什么不好的事发生在她身上，亚拉德什会很受打击的。",
      "source_text": "难以相信，坦蒂居然失踪了。我希望你能找找她。如果有什么不好的事发生在她身上，亚拉德什会很受打击的。",
      "source_line_start": 9,
      "source_line_end": 9,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Thanks for returning Tandi. It's a good sign for the future, don't you think?",
      "source_text": "Thanks for returning Tandi. It's a good sign for the future, don't you think?",
      "source_line_start": 10,
      "source_line_end": 10,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "谢谢你送回了坦蒂。这是个好兆头，对吧？",
      "source_text": "谢谢你送回了坦蒂。这是个好兆头，对吧？",
      "source_line_start": 11,
      "source_line_end": 11,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 11,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "That's a damn shame about Tandi. I hope Aradesh will be ok.",
      "source_text": "That's a damn shame about Tandi. I hope Aradesh will be ok.",
      "source_line_start": 12,
      "source_line_end": 12,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": false
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 12,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "那对坦蒂来说是奇耻大辱。我真希望亚拉德什不会太难过。",
      "source_text": "那对坦蒂来说是奇耻大辱。我真希望亚拉德什不会太难过。",
      "source_line_start": 13,
      "source_line_end": 13,
      "number_occurrence": 2,
      "number_occurrence_count": 2,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 13,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Welcome, stranger. We don't see your kind often.",
      "source_text": "Welcome, stranger. We don't see your kind often.",
